---
title: Validation · confirmation and non-success both have explicit paths
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending: ready Preview Version · agreed dataset + criteria
  state "Open Validation Attempt" as open {
    pending --> in_progress: same user · exact candidate · observation ready
    in_progress --> interrupted: originating user leaves
    interrupted --> in_progress: returns before the deadline
  }
  open --> abandoned: return deadline passed
  in_progress --> abandoned: change agreed out loud
  in_progress --> completed: outcome recorded
  state verdict <<choice>>
  completed --> verdict
  verdict --> delivered: validated · every criterion confirmed + observed
  verdict --> unvalidated: partial, negative, or unclear
  abandoned --> unvalidated: deadline closes the case
  abandoned --> gate_pending: change goes back to the gate
  state "Case File + draft PR" as delivered
  delivered: Frozen record of this exact candidate
  state "Unvalidated Case File" as unvalidated
  unvalidated: Unmet criteria or blocker
  unvalidated: No PR · revoke + clean up
  class delivered outcome
  class unvalidated external
  class gate_pending async
